onent possession count is largely definitional (steal starts a break).\n- observed_sample_and_power: n=911968; MADE_DEAD n=354564\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF-APPS-075\n- observed_verdict: descriptive"}, {"id": "FAM:SF-APPS-041", "score": 0.107, "document": "# FAM:SF-APPS-041 | Study family SF-APPS-041: PUTBACK suppression matched-pair isolation (star vs team)\n- observed_research_question: PUTBACK suppression matched-pair isolation (star vs team)\n- auto_outcome_status: artifact\n- observed_hypothesis: Conceding a PUTBACK causally suppresses the next offensive possession after matching on game state.\n- observed_result: TEAM ATT=-0.0038 CI[-0.025,+0.015] perm p=0.890 n_t=15614. STAR ATT=+0.0040 [-0.049,+0.052] p=0.834 n_t=2481. STAR Q4 ATT=-0.1045 [-0.217,+0.010] p=0.032 (gradient does not survive matching as a FINDING).\n- auto_failure_mechanism: C_artifact (apparent effect produced by a construction, selection or labelling flaw)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:confounding\n- auto_has_risk: RISK:CONFOUNDING\n- observed_failure_evidence: Raw putback suppression collapses once margin/state is matched; original finding was a score/context confound.\n- observed_sample_and_power: n_treated team=15614, star=2481\n- auto_validation_status: no_validation_recorded; evidence: NOT_RECORDED\n- auto_related_family: FAM:SF30"}, {"id": "FAM:SF35", "score": 0.097, "document": "# FAM:SF35 | Study family SF35: Next-game playing-time response to opponent 3P luck (carryover)\n- observed_research_question: Next-game playing-time response to opponent 3P luck (carryover)\n- auto_outcome_status: artifact\n- observed_hypothesis: Game-N opponent 3P luck while on court changes a player's game N+1 share and starting status.\n- observed_result: [CHT-070] Opp 3P luck next-game share +0.063 (0.018); holding Game N role +0.002 (0.018). Start prob +0.0004 (0.0003) n.s. 1 SD (6.0 points) ~11 seconds. Own FG luck carry-over +0.113 (0.023) survives. Verdict KILL for t [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- observed_result: [TMP-011] G_opp3 +0.0625 (0.0180), shuffle null -0.0002 sd 0.0159 p 0.000; starting +0.00041 (0.00027) perm p 0.150/0.630; controlling game-N share G_opp3 +0.0020 (0.0178); adding expected opp 3P pts +0.0284 (0.0179); bi [cut; read_family for the full text]\n- auto_failure_mechanism: C_artifact (apparent effect produced by a construction, selection or labelling flaw)\n- auto_limited_by: LIM:insufficient_exposure"}], "n_results": 4}

